.TH sync 1  "sync " 
.SH NAME
sync \- Synchronize checkpoint operations
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsync\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Synchronize checkpoint operations
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
sync\-flush\-only(1)
Flush checkpoint to JSONL file
.TP
sync\-import\-only(1)
Import checkpoint from JSONL file
.TP
sync\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
